    <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
      <name>DocumentsExportStartDate</name>
      <id>16</id>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
        <segments>Object.DocumentsExportStartDate</segments>
      </dataPath>
      <toolTip>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Only documents with a date greater than or equal to this date will be exported to standalone mode</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>فقط اسنادی با تاریخ بزرگ‌تر یا مساوی این تاریخ به حالت مستقل خارج می‌شوند</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>В автономный режим будут выгружаться только те документы, дата которых больше или равна этой</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Tek başına moda yalnızca tarihi bu tarihe eşit veya daha büyük olan belgeler aktarılacaktır</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Only documents with a date greater than or equal to this date will be exported to standalone mode</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Only documents with a date greater than or equal to this date will be exported to standalone mode</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Only documents with a date greater than or equal to this date will be exported to standalone mode</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
      <handlers>
        <event>OnChange</event>
        <name>DocumentsExportStartDateOnChange</name>
      </handlers>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>DocumentsExportStartDateExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>18</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
