    <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
      <name>EnableDataExchange</name>
      <id>13</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Enable data exchange</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>فعال‌سازی تبادل داده</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Включить обмен данными</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Veri alışverişini aç</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Enable data exchange</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Enable data exchange</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Enable data exchange</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
        <segments>Object.EnableDataExchange</segments>
      </dataPath>
      <titleLocation>Left</titleLocation>
      <toolTip>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Starts the initial exchange with the main infobase and regularly performs synchronization</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تبادل اولیه با پایگاه اطلاعات اصلی را آغاز و همگام‌سازی را به‌طور منظم انجام می‌دهد</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Запускает первоначальный обмен с основной базой и регулярно выполняет синхронизацию</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ana veritabanı ile ilk veri alışverişini başlatır ve düzenli olarak senkronizasyon yapar</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Starts the initial exchange with the main infobase and regularly performs synchronization</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Starts the initial exchange with the main infobase and regularly performs synchronization</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Starts the initial exchange with the main infobase and regularly performs synchronization</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
      <handlers>
        <event>OnChange</event>
        <name>EnableDataExchangeOnChange</name>
      </handlers>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>EnableDataExchangeExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>15</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>EnableDataExchangeContextMenu</name>
        <id>14</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>CheckBoxField</type>
      <editMode>EnterOnInput</editMode>
      <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
      <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
      <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo">
        <checkBoxType>Switcher</checkBoxType>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Standalone mode</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>حالت مستقل</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Lavoro in modalità autonoma</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Praca w trybie autonomicznym</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Работа в автономном режиме</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Bağımsız mod</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Standalone mode</value>
    </title>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>برنامه می‌تواند به‌صورت آفلاین کار کند. اگر به سرور اصلی متصل باشید، برنامه داده‌های لازم را در پایگاه اطلاعات محلی کپی می‌کند و پس از قطع اتصال، به حالت مستقل رفته و کار با داده‌ها را ادامه می‌دهد.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Приложение имеет возможность работать в автономном режиме. При наличии подключения к основному серверу приложение будет копировать необходимые данные в локальную базу, а после потери соединения переключится в автономный режим и продолжит работу с данными.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Uygulama tek başına modda çalışabilme özelliğine sahiptir. Ana sunucuya bağlantı olduğunda gerekli verileri yerel veritabanına kopyalar, bağlantı kesildiğinde ise tek başına moda geçer ve verilerle çalışmaya devam eder.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>StandaloneWorkplaceExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>20</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
